  "alt_text": {
    "alt_text": "Line chart of the real 60/40 growth index (monthly-rebalanced), January 1871 to June 2026. Axes: Year, Growth of $1, log scale. Real 60/40 (monthly-rebalanced) grows from 1.00 at January 1871 to 3,868 at June 2026, plotted on a log scale: equal slopes are equal growth rates. Extremes: the minimum is 0.983 at February 1871; the maximum is 3,868 at June 2026, the terminal value. 13 hatched bands mark the drawdown episodes of 15% or worse in real terms (peak-to-new-high stretches; the count is computed from the episodes artifact and stated in the keep-out band): hatch-only data-bad strokes, transparent fill. 2 series: the real growth line (primary, solid) and the drawdown bands (band, hatched).",
